                    description: Some("[Default policies only] Specifies the type of default policy to get. Specify one of the following:    VOLUME - To get only the default policy for EBS snapshots    INSTANCE - To get only the default policy for EBS-backed AMIs    ALL - To get all default policies"),
                    arguments: [
